## Red Daft OS
A coder-/security-first Linux distribution for red-teamers, security engineers,
AI developers, and power users. 100% free and open-source.

Highlights: hardened Daft-Kernel, `daft-pkg` native package manager, `.deb`
adapter, local AI (Ollama + Qwen), defensive `daft-ai-guard`, in-RAM
`daft-shell`, AMD ROCm support, and crimson/matte-black branding.

> Responsible use: all offensive capability is transparent, labeled, and
> authorization-gated. The kernel is hardened (not stealth) and ships a
> defensive rootkit/DKOM detector. The AI guard blocks weaponized content.

